  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e91b97f7fadef08d",
      "translationZh": "Q2_0 (2.40 bpw, 66.4 GB) : 零样本平均 78.00，高于 BF16 值 76.94，大约是原始大小的五分之一",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81ee6bd3c319d976",
      "translationZh": "Coder（能力裁剪模型）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d519c30aa434dd1",
      "translationZh": "与其在较低精度下存储每个参数，模型中一半的路由专家被移除：每层 512 中的 256，由 RCO 通过优化与未裁剪模型的 KL 散度来选择。保留的权重仍保持在 3.5 bpw。裁剪和量化的效果叠加，合并后的效果是原始 Transformer 每个参数平均 1.89 位。平均位宽将移除的专家摊薄到原始参数数量上，从而表达了裁剪和量化的联合效应。没有单独的权重存储为 1.89 位。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b30a642e07a76c64",
      "translationZh": "实际后果是，一个 176.9B 参数模型的常驻工作集为 29.6 GB，因为 n-gram 分片是一个查找表，可以从磁盘提供。这在单个 32 GB 加速器的容量范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ae21ffca308e0be",
      "translationZh": "SWE-bench Verified：75.60 对比 BF16 的 82.80，保留 91.3%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e7a9214c651cd3e",
      "translationZh": "LiveCodeBench v6：86.28 对比 87.43，保留 98.7%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84d7a4c990cbb759",
      "translationZh": "两者均在 xhigh 推理强度下测量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
